  "description": "Constructs deep-links and URLs for the AlphaGenome Atlas website. Supports generating single-variant exploration links (1-based VCF-style coordinates), genomic locus views (1-based closed chr:start-end), candidate summary tables, and AlphaGenome reference vs. alternate predictions. Use when visualizing, exploring, charting, or linking genetic variants and genomic loci on the AlphaGenome Atlas, or when asked to inspect, view, or link predictions for a genomic variant. Don't use for computing raw AlphaGenome variant predictions directly without Atlas URLs (use alphagenome-single-variant-analysis or alphagenome-variant-impact-score).",
